      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Row Data:{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nRules Clean the following student dataset:\n1. Trim leading and trailing spaces from all values.\n2. Remove empty rows and duplicate student records.\n3. Fix inconsistent capitalization (Title Case for names,Title case for city ,lowercase for emails).\n4. check phone number is 10 digits , if less then 10 digits set invalid\n5. Check email , if invalid email, set invalid email\n6. convert fee_paid , yes/Yes/Y/YES set true and No/no/N/NO=False\n7. course only machine learing or python or Data Science\n8. Enrolled Date set YYYY/MM/DD\n9. if city is null, set unknown\n10. Return ONLY a valid JSON output . Do not include explanations or markdown \n11.Delete duplicate rows\n\n",
